      "post_click_text": "SETTINGS\n\nChoose a theme.\t\nDefault\nTrue black\nMonokai\nSandblown\nHigh Contrast\nChoose font\t\nDefault\nOpen Dyslexic\nOKReset to Defaults\n\n\nv0.9.easter\n\n  \n\nNota Bao\n\n\nJosephine\nIt is Monday, Early morning, Day 1.\n\nMoney: £0\n🐣 Eggs: 0\nArousal: 0\n\n\nTrauma: 0\nAllure: 30\nInhibition: 125\nPurity: 25\n\nYou're freshly showered, and have a fruity aroma!\n\nYou're currently single. Loser.\n\nYou don't have a job!\n\n\nConsider supporting me on Patreon!\n\nBACKPACK\nHELP\nCHEATS\nSUPPORT\nSAVES\nSETTINGS\nRESTART\n\n\nAs you're walking down the street, nothing comes to mind. You are completely and utterly lost. Though there are some pretty storefronts along the side of this street.\n\nYou should find some way of making money.\nPerhaps check out this cute cafe\n\nGo further down the street\nGo further up the street\n\nJust enjoy the scenery and walk along",
